# 4. BUILD A HIGH-QUALITY ANIMATION SYSTEM

Create reusable animation utilities rather than writing disconnected animations throughout the application.

Implement appropriate versions of the following:

### Background animations
- Slowly drifting stars.
- Multiple layers of parallax particles.
