- Avoid excessive blur, especially across large full-screen surfaces.
- Ensure the interface remains usable on mid-range phones and laptops.

If a library such as Framer Motion, Motion, Three.js, or React Three Fiber is already installed, evaluate whether it should be reused before introducing another dependency.

